 "energy.help_talk_h": "Someone to talk to",
 "energy.help_talk": "If food or eating is hard for you, you are not alone. These help lines are free and open on weekdays: <a href=\"https://beateatingdisorders.org.uk/support-services/helplines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Beat</a> in the United Kingdom (0808&nbsp;801&nbsp;0677; in Scotland 0808&nbsp;801&nbsp;0432, in Wales 0808&nbsp;801&nbsp;0433, in Northern Ireland 0808&nbsp;801&nbsp;0434), the <a href=\"https://www.allianceforeatingdisorders.com/what-is-an-eating-disorder-helpline/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">National Alliance for Eating Disorders</a> in the United States (+1&nbsp;866&nbsp;662&nbsp;1235), and <a href=\"https://sosdisturbialimentari.it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SOS Disturbi Alimentari</a> in Italy (800&nbsp;180&nbsp;969).",
 "home.page_title": "Logicers: learning that feels like play",
 "home.page_desc": "Learning that feels like play. Games built on real facts, for every curious and intellectual mind.",
