 "home.players_said_aria": "What players said",
 "home.daily_games_h": "Today's daily games",
 "home.pitch_energy_long": "One real food or drink. Fill a plate or pour glasses of another until it holds the same energy, then see the real amount.",
 "home.pitch_hundred_long": "Of 100 people in the world, how many…? Hold, let go at your guess, see how it really is.",
 "home.pitch_call_long": "A real moment from history and three choices. What did they actually do?",
 "home.pitch_cousin_long": "One animal, three others. Which one is its closest relative?",
 "home.pitch_club_long": "Some are in the club, some are not. Work out the secret rule and decide who else gets in.",
 "home.pitch_apart_long": "Two real events, and a third one in between. Slide it to where you think it falls, then see the years.",
 "home.pitch_gets_long": "One real price, and the people paid out of it. Drag the lines to say who gets what, then see the real split.",
 "home.pitch_every_long": "One real animal and its heart. Drag to set how fast you think it beats, then see the real heart beat beside yours.",
 "home.pitch_o24_long": "An animal, or the people of a country. Shade how many hours a day they sleep, eat or work, then see the real hours.",
 "home.pass_h": "Pass the phone",
 "home.pass_sub": "Games for two or more, on one phone.",
 "home.pitch_twin_long": "One word, two languages. Read it out, talk it over, then all vote: does it mean the same, or is it a trap?",
 "home.pitch_o193_long": "The phone hides one of 193 countries. Ask it yes or no, and find the country in as few questions as you can.",
 "home.pitch_still_long": "Twelve countries and one rule. Take turns tapping one that fits. Wrong, and you are out.",
 "home.pitch_expert_long": "One of you gets five facts about a country, one of them invented, and sells all five. Can the table spot it?",
 "home.pitch_beat_long": "The whole table against the phone: ten stops round the world, three lives. Answer alone, or ask the table.",
 "home.pitch_beat_short": "Ten stops round the world, three lives. The table against the phone.",
 "home.more_to_come": "More to come",
