 "home.made_by": "Made by Khayyam. More about me →",
 "home.mail": "Question, mistake or idea? Write to me: <b>logicers.world@gmail.com</b>",
 "home.streak_lede": "A streak counts the days you played in a row. A wrong answer never breaks it. Everything is kept only in this browser.",
